{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act28side_level_act28side_st02",
  "groupId": "act28side",
  "stageId": "act28side_st02",
  "title": "突然衝擊",
  "storyCode": "CV-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "76bdadad042cc598208097b5596fc7ba31a2188a94c8e4f7f5e0fae23b8fbc28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "優等生，我們在這裡傻等快一天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總部信使給我們帶回來的消息，你應該也看了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_106_franka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "消息說他們預計會在明天下午到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "消息上還說，我們需要提前一天準備接駁需要的各項事宜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_106_franka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達維鎮的接駁功能本來就沒什麼問題，羅拉花了半天就全部準備好了，然後我們就帶著所有人在這兒乾站著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你覺得太冷，隨時可以去那邊臨時搭的帳篷裡烤烤火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_106_franka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可如果我不是覺得冷，而是……害怕呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "害怕什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_106_franka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道，我只是……不知道達維鎮的事到底會怎麼收場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雷蛇略顯焦躁地把通訊器貼到耳邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有可接收的訊號，這證明那艘被黑鋼幹員們稱為“本艦”的巴倫基地還未進入通訊的範圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潔西卡，不再烤一下火了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不了……天馬上就要黑了，無論如何都會覺得冷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潔西卡，你也別太擔心，雖然銀行確實讓人生氣，但本艦馬上就要來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆可不會讓銀行那些傢伙騎到我們頭上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……老闆？哪個老闆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還能有哪個老闆，克里夫先生啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也說不準，畢竟……說到底克里夫先生是個生意人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潔西卡沉默著看向平台的方向，手習慣性地伸進口袋，摩挲著其中的子彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……潔西卡，你看那裡，是不是有火光……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就地塊上，靠近礦廠廠區的部分，可能是取暖失火了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，不對，起火點不止一個……這、這究竟……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4105_almond_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潔西卡？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊音",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……小隊，黑鋼……艦預計將在……後到達……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潔西卡，你去告訴大家——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊長，地塊上有數個起火點，不知道出了什麼問題，我得去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_106_franka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼偏偏是這種時候……但我們已經收到了本艦發來的訊號，巴倫基地離我們已經不遠了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_106_franka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潔西卡——潔西卡！你到底要去哪？！隊長，怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "avg_107_liskam_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓她去吧……我們繼續接駁任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼聲音啊，大晚上的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡來的動靜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人在砸動力爐？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伍德洛將枕頭下的銃械摸出，凝神細聽從樓下傳來的響動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伍迪，快下來！有人闖進來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘔……難受死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早知道……就不喝那麼多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睏死了，就地躺倒算了……這樣明早肯定就在街邊凍僵硬了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼聲音……怎麼回事……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼工程小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老、老伯你快走，這裡……唔、這些人突然闖了進來……又砸又搶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵……原來是你啊，老爺子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是當時雪地上的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我命很大的……老爺子，噓，千萬不要聲張，會引來其他人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺子，當時你很幸運，從我手中逃過一劫，不知道現在還有沒有這個運氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼工程小隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老伯，快走！你一個人對付不了的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "42_g3_diner"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老傢伙，你居然也在這裡啊。不錯，省得待會再去找你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海倫娜，怎麼回事？我以為等我下樓，這裡已經躺滿你打倒的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4104_coldst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……他們這次膽子大了不少，大概是真瘋了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位別自顧自說悄悄話啊，有什麼好消息不如講出來一起分享一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是不知天高地厚的兔崽子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老傢伙，那些子彈一定很珍貴吧，珍貴到……你連一個六發的彈巢都沒有裝滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想也是，這地塊上供你用的材料也沒有幾樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不然，這麼多年了，你天天拿著那把銃，怎麼幾乎沒聽說過你給誰來上一發呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟們，先把這兩個老傢伙放倒，然後就當這裡是自己家，看上什麼就拿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這些人，幹……幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作亂的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醉鬼，讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰、誰讓你在……在這裡鬧事的，呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作亂的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大叔，我再請你喝一瓶，你好好睡一覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬧事的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥，真有你的，醉鬼就該往他臉上來一酒瓶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作亂的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬧事的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "東西拿夠了，我們去下一家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里昂，你還好嗎……我先扶你起來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，這群兔崽子下手真狠，你臉上全是血……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事……就是頭暈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這店裡面怎麼也被砸成這樣……他們不光砸了櫥窗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何止是櫥窗……他們幾乎把我搶乾淨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚到底怎麼了？"
