    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺子，我們時間很寶貴的，就別玩捉迷藏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡詐的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在這對不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煩死人了，這地方又狹窄，障礙物又多，根本施展不開……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狡詐的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以別他媽到處亂竄了，老不死的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個腿腳，居然還能避開這一下，真是小看你了。看看運氣能眷顧你到什麼時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，終於逮到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能死在這破地方也挺好，和你很配。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1038_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（就再來一下……堅持住，你這把老骨頭，能行的……一定能行。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於可以和你說再見了，老頭。"
