    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。我的彈巢確實沒滿，為了讓它們能在我的銃裡擊發，我也確實花了不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以……我不會把子彈用在你們身上，太不值了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將手銃收回腰間的皮套，老人解開了袖扣，將袖子挽高露出手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4104_coldst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是吧，伍迪……都這把年紀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有多長時間沒看我用繩圈了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4104_coldst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從你把地塊外面那些牧獸都賣給商隊換物資……大概三四年了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯，才三四年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去收拾領頭那幾個傢伙，剩下的你能搞定嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4104_coldst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，交給我吧。"
