    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快點的好……離天亮還早，能再好好睡一覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，附近沒有幾棵樹能把你們吊起來，不過房檐下……也不是不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，都把我們圍得水洩不通了，還沒人敢打頭陣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別得意，老東西，還有你好看的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們最近都聽說了什麼？今晚到底怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就剩這些繃帶了，不夠纏的，你先拿著捂在腦袋上吧……要不然血淋淋的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，你說你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最初是從地塊東邊傳來的消息，你也知道，不務正業的小流氓都聚在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說是鎮子裡有很多人都覺得，反正怎麼也還不上銀行的錢，不如……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如狠狠搶一筆……逃去拓荒地重新開始……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也看見了，剛剛他們跟瘋了一樣，到處打人、砸店、搶劫……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "落魄的店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，里昂，快來看，那是……你家的方向……"
