    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是非想挨子彈，我也可以滿足你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自己選下一處吧，左腳還是左手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你根本不知道……就算逃過了我們……逃過了今天……還會有別人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們一個都別想逃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與其操心我們，不如先想想自己吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1044_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼聲音——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "42_g8_abandonedblock"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1043_1",
