    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潔西卡，你怎麼會在這裡？你、你這是幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里昂先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒在裡面啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到了，潔西卡，看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無措的地塊居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里昂先生，這孩子一直說要進去火場找你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我以為你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……孩子，你別哭了，我還活得好好的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你、你的房子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的……沒事……我可以去海倫娜那裡住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，家裡只有我一個人，天天望著空蕩蕩的牆壁，心裡也難受……燒了也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以後就……再也不惦記了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦……怎麼辦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦？我都說了，燒了就燒了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_1034_jesca2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦，怎麼辦，怎麼辦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1035_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是，潔西卡，什麼怎麼辦？到底出什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "42_g11_blacksteelplatform"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1040_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒂拉，我看你來來回回進出克里夫先生的辦公室，難道雷蛇小隊失手了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1040_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，雖然地塊上確實出現了一些突發情況，但雷蛇小隊完成了他們的任務，本艦馬上就要和達維鎮碰面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我懂了，那些欠債的人知道我們來了之後肯定沒他們的好處，所以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1040_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請謹言慎行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我的錯我的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過克里夫先生怎麼說？該不會因為有人鬧事就改變主意了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼情報小組成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1040_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切按原計劃執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鋼資深幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1045_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……看來我們終於快要到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "起初，是一縷異樣的空氣，拂動了人們的髮絲。\n接著，是一陣從每個人腳底傳來的震動。\n最後，是一聲從數百米外的高空傳來的巨大轟鳴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "衝破冬夜濃重的霧氣，經過半個月的行駛後，巴倫基地抵達了。\n所有人聚在街頭，站在窗口，看向它駛來的方向。\n無論人們是歡迎，或是抗拒，它都來了。\n無論今夜是噩夢，還是美夢，都驚醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "42_g1_mine"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "掂了掂手中的銃械，事情做到一半被打斷，讓伍德洛心裡很不高興。\n將目光從遠處的艦船上收回，伍德洛看到地上的男人早已不見蹤影，只留下一行長長的血跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵……剛剛應該先對他的腳來顆子彈的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1034_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
